    unclassified outputs                                        138

runtime opencode — 10 files
  always loaded                                                  65
    skill listing (2)                                            65
      names (2)                                                   4
      descriptions (2)                                            7
      per-entry framing (estimate) (2)                           54
  on demand                                                     453
    skill bodies (2)                                             94
    command bodies (2)                                           27
    agent bodies (2)                                             39
